server/.venv
**/__pycache__
# server/static/ is served as a tree, so anything that lands in it ships. These
# are gitignored (so a clone-built image never sees them) but an image built
# from a working copy would otherwise serve a developer's .DS_Store and the
# tooling cache, which carries absolute local paths.
**/.DS_Store
**/.impeccable
watcher/watcher_config.json
Dockerfile
docker-compose.yml
.env
.env.example
